    "K_t": "Evidence:\n[1] Lady Macbeth is a 2016 British drama film directed by William Oldroyd and written by Alice Birch, based on the novel \"Lady Macbeth of the Mtsensk District\" by Nikolai Leskov.\n[2] Lady Macbeth of the Mtsensk District (Russian: \"Леди Макбет Мценского уезда\" , or \"Ledi Makbet Mtsenskogo uyezda\") is an opera in four acts and nine scenes by Dmitri Shostakovich, his Opus 29.\n[3] Iphigénie en Tauride (\"Iphigenia in Tauris\") is a 1779 opera by Christoph Willibald Gluck in four acts.\n[4] Iphigénie en Tauride (English: \"Iphigeneia in Tauris\") is an opera by the French composers Henri Desmarets and André Campra."
